  "consumed": "AssKick Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br><strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (4 hours): the first damage you take each Round (after armor) is reduced by 1, or 2 if it came with a Critical Injury; COOL and TECH -2 (minimum 1); you feel fearless and amped. Secondary (DV17): addiction. While addicted and not on AssKick: -2 to Athletics, Concentration, Endurance, Perception, Stealth, and Tactics.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>While addicted, switch on the \"AssKick Addiction\" effect.</li><li>When an addicted character doses, use \"AssKick Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li><li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
  },
